WEBVTT

00:07.270 --> 00:12.820
The Faraway Paladin

00:09.110 --> 00:12.820
<b><u>The Lord of the Rust Mountains</u></b>

01:30.100 --> 01:36.320
The Land of Flowers

01:39.320 --> 01:40.730
What are you doing?!

01:40.730 --> 01:43.610
Waking you up with an intense kiss.

01:43.610 --> 01:45.920
How are you feeling, fellow forest dweller?

01:45.920 --> 01:48.740
Feel like you want to puke,
head hurt, anything like that?

01:48.740 --> 01:51.140
S-Such crude speech!

01:51.140 --> 01:53.140
Sure sounds like you're feeling well.

01:54.260 --> 01:57.770
Wait... When you said k-kiss...

01:58.380 --> 01:59.500
Don't tell me you...

01:59.500 --> 02:02.510
Relax. It was just a wine bottle.

02:07.480 --> 02:09.850
<b>The stars shine upon our meeting.</b>

02:11.350 --> 02:14.900
Sorry for startling you. 
I wasn't brought up that well.

02:15.550 --> 02:17.360
I'm Meneldor of Isil.

02:18.270 --> 02:20.820
I am Dinelind of Remmirath,

02:20.820 --> 02:24.870
swift-winged eagle of the silver moon.

02:25.310 --> 02:28.150
May our meeting be blessed,

02:28.150 --> 02:32.500
young lady embodying the enchanting 
silence of the shining net of stars.

02:33.850 --> 02:35.780
So you <i>can</i> speak normally.

02:36.360 --> 02:39.070
Elf etiquette really isn't my thing.

02:39.070 --> 02:40.850
Don't make me say any more than that.

02:44.800 --> 02:49.290
My apologies. 
Might you be the leader of this group?

02:49.650 --> 02:53.310
A pleasure to make your acquaintance. 
I am Dinelind.

02:53.890 --> 02:56.130
I'm William G. Maryblood.

02:57.650 --> 02:59.970
You saved my life.

02:59.970 --> 03:02.950
I thank you from the bottom of my heart.

03:04.800 --> 03:06.570
Slay the dragon?

03:06.570 --> 03:09.710
Just the five of you?
Are you serious?

03:09.710 --> 03:13.200
You think we'd come this far into the 
middle of nowhere if we weren't?

03:13.200 --> 03:17.630
You, perhaps, but I'm sure 
William would do no such thing.

03:17.630 --> 03:19.730
He seems quite honest and sincere.

03:19.730 --> 03:20.450
Tch.

03:21.720 --> 03:23.640
I realize it's crazy.

03:24.210 --> 03:26.700
But we still have to do it.

03:27.910 --> 03:30.860
I see. You are brave.

03:31.800 --> 03:35.090
Why were you taking on a 
hydra in a place like that?

03:35.940 --> 03:38.670
It is somewhat of a long story...

03:38.670 --> 03:41.030
Let's eat first, then.

03:41.030 --> 03:43.950
You can't trust an elf's "somewhat."

03:50.730 --> 03:53.790
Um... Is that okay?

03:53.790 --> 03:54.580
Huh?

03:54.580 --> 03:57.760
I mean... I thought elves didn't eat meat...

03:58.060 --> 04:00.010
The only elves who don't eat meat

04:00.370 --> 04:05.100
are those who have undergone a great deal of 
training to enhance their spirit qualities.

04:06.040 --> 04:07.520
This is delicious.

04:08.190 --> 04:10.650
You look like you haven't eaten in ages.

04:11.900 --> 04:17.140
Do you not have some inkling as to 
what I was doing in that place?

04:17.140 --> 04:22.660
Because a proud elf cannot 
abandon the weak, right?

04:24.700 --> 04:25.500
Yes.

04:26.490 --> 04:27.960
It's how they reduce their numbers.

04:29.130 --> 04:32.700
Even if there's not enough 
food to support everyone,

04:32.700 --> 04:36.140
elves never cast the sick or elderly aside.

04:36.540 --> 04:39.390
The young, healthy ones who can fight

04:39.390 --> 04:41.910
voluntarily leave their 
own communities instead.

04:42.480 --> 04:46.790
Exactly. To banish those who 
are weak is unthinkable.

04:47.150 --> 04:49.330
You're an elf through and through.

04:49.330 --> 04:51.890
What does that mean?
Are you belittling me?

04:51.890 --> 04:53.820
It was a compliment. Jeez...

04:54.880 --> 04:56.910
Elves never change, I see.

04:57.320 --> 05:01.710
Dinelind, would you take us to your village?

05:01.710 --> 05:04.660
If you can show us how 
to get to the mountains,

05:04.660 --> 05:06.400
we'll do everything we can.

05:07.630 --> 05:09.160
You can call me Dine.

05:14.980 --> 05:16.900
Looks pretty bad.

05:17.700 --> 05:21.150
There's more than just the demons' 
Words of Taboo at work here.

05:21.150 --> 05:24.360
Yes. It's the evil dragon's miasma.

05:25.260 --> 05:26.660
The evil dragon?

05:26.970 --> 05:28.540
It defiles the forest,

05:28.540 --> 05:31.460
degrading it year after year, 
as if it is necrosing.

05:32.220 --> 05:34.620
There are more and more 
strange beasts, as well.

05:34.620 --> 05:38.810
The fog and mire block our 
contact with other clans.

05:39.550 --> 05:41.930
The mountains, our only landmark,

05:42.270 --> 05:44.220
are now the dragon's and demons' den.

05:51.460 --> 05:53.190
That sums it up.

05:53.190 --> 05:56.710
But the dragon is supposed 
to be in the mountains.

05:56.710 --> 05:59.070
How has the miasma come this far?

06:00.420 --> 06:03.500
Through underground tunnels 
built by the dwarfs.

06:06.300 --> 06:11.170
The dragon's miasma pours into all parts 
of the forest from underground tunnels.

06:11.680 --> 06:13.670
Th-That's...

06:15.050 --> 06:16.640
Don't worry.

06:16.640 --> 06:18.590
Your people are not to blame.

06:29.140 --> 06:32.940
The powers of the fae have 
weakened throughout this region,

06:32.940 --> 06:37.210
and the water, air, and food are all poisoned.

06:38.970 --> 06:40.310
Lothdor...

06:40.740 --> 06:44.210
The days when it was a beautiful 
land of flowers have long passed.

06:44.900 --> 06:48.340
Now it is, at best, the land of the half-dead.

06:48.850 --> 06:54.430
So we never imagined heroes would come 
from outside to slay the dragon.

06:56.180 --> 06:58.740
Welcome to Lothdor.

06:58.740 --> 07:01.700
I warmly welcome you, heroes.

07:03.020 --> 07:05.990
Please allow me to heal your critically ill.

07:05.990 --> 07:09.580
Can we allow human strangers who 
have appeared from nowhere...

07:10.150 --> 07:14.230
...access to our weakened compatriots?

07:14.540 --> 07:15.790
These people—

07:15.790 --> 07:16.860
This offer has come...

07:16.860 --> 07:20.370
from a warrior with weapons most impressive.

07:23.190 --> 07:25.350
Let me cure that cough for you.

07:25.350 --> 07:27.520
Wait... I should not be the one...

07:28.010 --> 07:30.740
Goddess of light, Gracefeel...

07:42.360 --> 07:44.860
The coughing stopped...

07:46.180 --> 07:49.020
Gather together those who display 
the most severe symptoms.

07:49.020 --> 07:52.830
I'll visit those who are too 
critically ill to move in order.

07:52.830 --> 07:59.690
But healing through blessings takes a great 
toll on one's vitality and concentration.

07:59.690 --> 08:01.580
If you heal so many...

08:01.970 --> 08:05.100
If it's a hundred or two, 
it won't be a problem.

08:05.100 --> 08:06.620
I'll heal them all.

08:40.790 --> 08:42.610
Goddess of light...

08:51.020 --> 08:53.940
Using a poison-neutralizing 
blessing to sober yourself up?

08:53.940 --> 08:55.730
How very tasteless.

08:55.730 --> 08:59.360
This is enemy territory.
I can't let my guard down.

08:59.920 --> 09:01.960
Is your journey going well?

09:01.960 --> 09:04.190
Yes, for now—ouch!

09:07.510 --> 09:09.860
A warning from Gracefeel, eh?

09:10.200 --> 09:13.990
Gracefeel truly does love you.

09:14.500 --> 09:18.390
What do you say?
Wouldn't you like me to love you, too?

09:18.390 --> 09:19.960
Spare me your jokes.

09:20.440 --> 09:22.940
Well? What do you want?

09:22.940 --> 09:25.080
Only to warn you.

09:26.380 --> 09:30.510
If you wish to turn back, 
this will likely be your last chance.

09:31.460 --> 09:33.260
If you attempt this, you will die.

09:35.600 --> 09:38.640
Flee now and amass more strength.

09:39.590 --> 09:42.990
If I do that, Al and his 
people will probably die.

09:42.990 --> 09:45.820
Yes, the dwarfs will die.

09:45.820 --> 09:48.640
When the dragon eventually awakens for real,

09:48.640 --> 09:53.280
many thousands will die, 
human and elf alike.

09:53.280 --> 09:56.390
But the damage done by the evil dragon

09:56.390 --> 10:00.800
will bring more followers to you 
and your goddess, Gracefeel.

10:00.800 --> 10:05.780
Many skilled warriors from across the 
land will rise to slay the dragon.

10:06.130 --> 10:09.320
Among them will surely be 
disciples of the virtuous gods,

10:09.320 --> 10:11.710
and you will lead them.

10:12.530 --> 10:16.350
Gracefeel will have regained her power, 
and you will earn her blessing.

10:16.350 --> 10:20.890
Then it will be possible for your blade 
to reach the evil dragon's throat.

10:21.320 --> 10:25.470
I am loathe to even suggest this,

10:25.470 --> 10:27.800
but it would be best to 
permit some sacrifices.

10:28.190 --> 10:32.250
It would not be cowardly. It 
would be an act of bravery.

10:34.150 --> 10:35.450
I can't do that.

10:35.450 --> 10:39.340
Why? Are you so desperate to save everyone?

10:39.690 --> 10:42.490
Even if several thousand are 
sacrificed in this way,

10:42.490 --> 10:48.200
should you die now, tens of thousands 
more will die in the future.

10:48.200 --> 10:52.450
You would rather endanger ten times, 
even a hundred times, as many lives?

10:53.020 --> 10:58.210
And a warrior comparable to you 
will not show up immediately.

10:59.440 --> 11:01.230
I understand what you've said.

11:01.230 --> 11:02.040
Then—

11:02.040 --> 11:05.710
But the moment I accept your proposal,

11:05.710 --> 11:08.520
my promise and my faith 
will be both be broken.

11:09.250 --> 11:12.610
You've made a sound argument 
with full knowledge of that

11:13.150 --> 11:14.970
in hopes of breaking my spirit...

11:15.370 --> 11:17.820
In hopes of bringing me to your side.

11:18.810 --> 11:20.150
Am I wrong?

11:22.210 --> 11:24.270
I'm a weak person.

11:24.270 --> 11:27.870
I'll just drift in the easiest 
direction, lose heart, and give up.

11:27.870 --> 11:32.320
I realize I'm just a human 
with an ever-changing heart.

11:33.320 --> 11:37.900
But the goddess taught me 
that I can still start over.

11:39.360 --> 11:43.110
I met family and friends I could cherish,

11:43.110 --> 11:45.670
and I found things I need to 
do and things I want to do.

11:46.140 --> 11:49.310
And that's why I'm going 
to see them through.

11:49.310 --> 11:51.740
Until the moment I fall over dead,

11:51.740 --> 11:54.510
I will continue to serve 
as her hand and her sword.

11:55.250 --> 11:57.620
On the light of Gracefeel.

11:58.920 --> 12:02.740
Rats. I've failed to persuade you yet again.

12:04.610 --> 12:06.610
You are correct.

12:07.470 --> 12:10.460
Your soul is not very strong.

12:10.460 --> 12:15.030
If you give up, you will lose heart 
and fall. That's all it's worth.

12:15.890 --> 12:19.500
Still, you have turned my 
expectations on their head.

12:19.990 --> 12:23.190
You took me on and defeated me.

12:25.170 --> 12:30.360
In a paradoxical way, 
I suppose that's what makes you a hero.

12:31.760 --> 12:34.900
I never set out with the 
intention of being a hero.

12:35.720 --> 12:37.820
You realize your own weakness,

12:37.820 --> 12:40.400
but you make it your reason 
not to give up or lose heart,

12:40.400 --> 12:43.330
and even death cannot deter you 
from doing what you believe in.

12:43.780 --> 12:46.540
That is precisely what 
people call being a hero.

12:47.570 --> 12:49.820
I will say it one more time.

12:49.820 --> 12:52.770
Become mine, paladin.

12:52.770 --> 12:55.570
You will serve as my right hand.

12:55.570 --> 13:00.450
Let us kill the dragon, take down 
all heroes, destroy all the gods,

13:00.450 --> 13:02.710
and conquer this world.

13:03.090 --> 13:05.050
You and I.

13:06.180 --> 13:08.070
I respectfully decline.

13:08.680 --> 13:13.330
After all, I know you don't like 
to see heroes fall from grace.

13:17.050 --> 13:19.960
I won't be swayed by your invitation.

13:19.960 --> 13:22.060
I will continue to be your enemy.

13:23.090 --> 13:25.730
Because I respect you.

13:28.560 --> 13:30.310
Still, what a shame!

13:30.310 --> 13:34.340
You will die. The dragon will rip you apart.

13:34.340 --> 13:38.460
Farewell, my foolish, clever enemy!

13:43.280 --> 13:45.750
Come on, just let me go already.

13:45.750 --> 13:48.250
I told you, I can't let you go!

13:48.250 --> 13:51.380
I see it's true that elves 
of Isil have no principles!

13:51.380 --> 13:54.510
I don't wanna hear that from a "keep 
it face-to-face" Remmirath elf!

13:54.790 --> 13:56.830
Oh, just a lovers' squabble?

13:58.420 --> 13:59.420
Hang on, now.

13:59.420 --> 14:01.190
What did you just say?

14:01.650 --> 14:03.140
E-Eh...

14:04.800 --> 14:08.570
We have no time to waste on love affairs.

14:08.570 --> 14:10.400
Th-That's true...

14:10.400 --> 14:12.220
Yeah, not at a time like this.

14:12.220 --> 14:14.500
Even I can catch <i>that</i> much of a clue.

14:14.500 --> 14:16.440
And if it wasn't a time like this?

14:16.440 --> 14:18.800
I'd say it, sure. I mean, she's pretty.

14:18.800 --> 14:19.720
Pr—

14:19.720 --> 14:24.840
Dropping a slick compliment or two 
whenever I see her is just good manners.

14:25.560 --> 14:27.790
I guess I just don't get it...

14:27.790 --> 14:31.530
You really are just ectoccako niragamose!

14:31.530 --> 14:34.310
Yeah, well, I'd say you're onomoc nag.

14:34.310 --> 14:36.170
Excuse me?!

14:37.270 --> 14:38.850
The local Lord of the Forest?

14:38.850 --> 14:41.900
Yeah. I should be able to 
heal it, at least a little.

14:42.340 --> 14:45.240
Oh, right. The way you are now...

14:46.320 --> 14:47.680
Absolutely not!

14:47.680 --> 14:49.300
Okay, look...

14:49.300 --> 14:52.670
You know, Menel can be trusted.

14:52.670 --> 14:55.440
I do trust what you two say.

14:56.330 --> 14:59.830
There's no telling how many 
elves you saved last night.

14:59.830 --> 15:01.220
I'm grateful to you.

15:01.220 --> 15:02.470
Then, why?

15:03.340 --> 15:07.590
The area around the Lord of the 
Forest is demon beast territory.

15:07.590 --> 15:09.600
It's not our land.

15:09.810 --> 15:10.630
Then...

15:10.630 --> 15:13.170
We should depend on you?

15:13.170 --> 15:17.140
Ask you to fight yet another battle,

15:17.140 --> 15:19.480
when you're heading into one already?

15:20.040 --> 15:23.870
Beg you to help us because we 
can't handle it ourselves,

15:23.870 --> 15:26.810
to put off what you came here to do?

15:26.810 --> 15:28.660
I absolutely refuse!

15:28.660 --> 15:31.740
I will not make such a shameless request!

15:32.510 --> 15:35.010
See? That's an elf for ya.

15:35.010 --> 15:38.270
The elves truly haven't changed.

15:38.770 --> 15:40.730
What should we do?

15:40.730 --> 15:42.990
Whatever you want.

15:42.990 --> 15:45.250
I see. Okay, let's do that.

15:45.720 --> 15:47.270
Do you know where in the forest he is?

15:47.270 --> 15:49.310
He's weak, but I can sense him.

15:49.730 --> 15:53.320
Ghelreis, round up Al and Reystov for us.

15:53.320 --> 15:54.730
Have them come fully armed.

15:54.730 --> 15:55.630
Right.

15:55.630 --> 15:58.310
Wait a minute!
What are you talking about?

15:58.310 --> 16:00.110
A demon beast extermination, of course.

16:00.110 --> 16:02.010
I just told you, we—

16:02.010 --> 16:05.090
But there's no reason to 
complain if <i>we</i> do it, right?

16:05.090 --> 16:10.530
Just so you know, a few magic beasts 
aren't enough to beat me or him.

16:12.690 --> 16:14.770
Oh, fine, then!

16:14.770 --> 16:17.000
I'll go call for some of our best talents!

16:17.000 --> 16:19.090
Don't you dare leave on your own!

16:20.880 --> 16:25.930
The demon beasts who've made the Lord of the 
Forest's throne their turf are insect-types.

16:26.170 --> 16:28.790
The earwigs' defensive power 
is particularly troublesome.

16:30.870 --> 16:32.370
This must be it!

16:35.810 --> 16:37.760
This will make good training.

16:38.490 --> 16:40.690
And purple moths attack from the sky!

16:41.090 --> 16:42.080
Right.

16:44.800 --> 16:47.010
Careful! Their wing scales are poison!

16:47.450 --> 16:48.260
Got it.

16:52.320 --> 16:53.880
Okay, let's go.

17:31.310 --> 17:32.570
Good job.

17:32.570 --> 17:33.520
Yep.

17:34.700 --> 17:37.770
William, are you sure about this?

17:37.770 --> 17:39.140
Why do you ask?

17:39.140 --> 17:43.960
If the dragon or the demons 
notice you doing this...

17:44.280 --> 17:45.760
That would be bad.

17:45.760 --> 17:46.870
Then—

17:47.710 --> 17:48.780
But...

17:49.390 --> 17:52.560
To ignore this and move 
on would be even worse.

17:52.890 --> 17:55.740
Al, Reystov, Ghelreis...

17:56.290 --> 17:59.140
I'm sorry for getting you all 
involved in my own problem.

17:59.140 --> 18:00.800
You don't need to worry.

18:00.800 --> 18:06.100
Without you, we wouldn't 
have even made it this far.

18:06.100 --> 18:08.240
The young master is correct.

18:08.240 --> 18:10.020
Yeah. Nothing new.

18:10.020 --> 18:12.220
I'm more worried about you.

18:12.220 --> 18:14.510
You're planning to just charge 
straight in, aren't you?

18:14.510 --> 18:15.490
Yes.

18:15.490 --> 18:17.480
What? Straight in?

18:17.930 --> 18:20.920
Could you show me to the 
nearest underground tunnel?

18:20.920 --> 18:24.290
One that leads to the Rust Mountains, 
where the dragon is.

18:25.980 --> 18:29.140
If the enemy is going to find us, 
better sooner than later.

18:29.140 --> 18:30.460
Please.

18:31.530 --> 18:32.830
Very well.

18:35.570 --> 18:38.260
I will send one back to the 
village to inform them.

18:38.260 --> 18:41.710
So take the rest of us with 
you to where the dragon is.

18:41.710 --> 18:44.260
We can be decoys or shields, at least.

18:44.260 --> 18:46.770
No need for that. You lack the strength.

18:48.460 --> 18:51.140
We can't afford to take 
people who'll slow us down.

18:52.760 --> 18:55.030
After you've done so much for us,

18:55.910 --> 18:58.200
you'll simply march on to your death?

18:58.200 --> 18:58.970
Yes.

18:59.860 --> 19:01.400
How humiliating.

19:02.800 --> 19:06.230
Very well. We shall do as you say.

19:06.230 --> 19:07.860
But, Dinelind!

19:07.860 --> 19:09.340
This is just too—

19:09.340 --> 19:13.620
Would you add another layer to our shame 
by averting your eyes to our weakness?

19:15.720 --> 19:20.190
Right now, no matter how hard we fight, 
we are sick and weak.

19:21.250 --> 19:22.740
We are weaklings.

19:25.680 --> 19:28.340
This way. Follow me.

19:30.800 --> 19:32.580
You should've let me do that.

19:32.580 --> 19:35.540
No, I needed to be the one to say it.

19:38.800 --> 19:40.240
The west gate...

19:40.690 --> 19:44.550
I never dreamed I would come here again.

19:44.550 --> 19:47.940
This is the entrance to the Iron Country...

19:48.840 --> 19:51.330
You're really going on?

19:51.330 --> 19:52.100
Yes.

19:53.210 --> 19:56.960
<b>Knock, and it shall be opened</b>

19:53.210 --> 19:56.960
"Pulsate et aperietur vobis."

19:57.870 --> 20:01.590
Al, knock on the door. That's the signal.

20:01.590 --> 20:02.820
Sir Will...

20:03.740 --> 20:05.590
Are you sure I should do it?

20:05.870 --> 20:10.090
No one has the right to 
open this door but you.

20:11.090 --> 20:12.130
Right.

20:46.000 --> 20:47.560
Fortia!

20:46.050 --> 20:47.550
<b>Strength</b>

20:54.830 --> 20:57.040
They did notice us.

20:57.560 --> 20:59.490
The Calamity's Sickle...

20:59.490 --> 21:01.770
The evil dragon, Valacirca...

21:03.210 --> 21:04.280
Damn it.

21:08.560 --> 21:09.700
You...

21:10.440 --> 21:13.120
You intend to go up against this?

21:13.580 --> 21:16.380
Yes. That's what we came for.

21:17.530 --> 21:18.540
Lumen.

21:17.580 --> 21:18.340
<b>Light</b>

21:20.050 --> 21:22.290
We came to reclaim the mountains,

21:22.290 --> 21:24.590
to reclaim peace.

21:25.650 --> 21:27.150
So we'll be going now.

21:30.980 --> 21:31.940
Wait!

21:33.940 --> 21:38.290
We, the elves of Lothdor, 
will not forget our debt to you.

21:38.290 --> 21:42.140
I hereby swear to our 
ancestral god, Rhea Silvia,

21:42.690 --> 21:46.750
that we will return the favor one day.

21:47.690 --> 21:51.840
I pray the blessings of the virtuous 
gods and the spirits of courage

21:51.840 --> 21:54.640
will be with you as you go.

23:35.720 --> 23:39.930
A Warrior's Fire
